Repeat robustly without provoking a strong immune response from the host.
It is here that the secrets of observing asymptomatic wearers lie and what causes cases of severe infection in humans.
Strict symptoms are mainly due to hyperactivating immune response and cytokinetic shock; the stronger the immune response, the more severe the lung les lesions.
On the other hand, in asymptomatic carriers, the immune response was decoupled from CoV replication.
